    "detailed_description": "&quot;CIRCLE = CIRCLE&quot; is a simulation adventure game where you participate in a creative doujinshi sale event.<br />\r\nEnjoy the sale by selling books and talking to the characters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are many unique characters at the sale event.<br />\r\nDepending on the genre of the book sold at the sale event and conversations with the characters,<br />\r\nNew encounters and farewells await.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomers may not always come to the sale event.<br />\r\nAt times like these, spend your time drawing in your sketchbook.<br />\r\nSometimes customers ask me to draw pictures in their sketchbooks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is not just about selling books.<br />\r\nIt's also important to deepen your relationship with the characters.",
